   "sentenceId": 9,
   "he": "שֶׁל מַעֲשֵׂר שֵׁנִי שֶׁבִּירוּשָׁלַיִם. לְמַאן דְּאָמַר מִפְּנֵי שֶׁמַּכְשִׁירָהּ — הֲרֵי מַכְשִׁירָהּ, לְמַאן דְּאָמַר מִפְּנֵי שֶׁמַּפְסִידָהּ — הֲרֵי מַפְסִידָה.",
   "en": "§ The mishna continues: With regard to an etrog «of second tithe in Jerusalem, one may not take it,» ab initio. The Gemara explains: «According to the one who says» that an etrog of pure teruma is unfit «because one renders it susceptible» to ritual impurity, «here too, he renders it susceptible. According to the one who says» it is unfit «because one damages» the peel, «here too, he damages» the peel."
  }
